5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location to understand our actual financial boundaries.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I will review the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the board minutes on a jointly run clinic. I want to see what our previous efforts actually achieved.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I will look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I want to understand the current pressure on our teams.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records! I want to make sure we actually have the space and the slots to make something new work.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe it is important to see where our previous collaborations have struggled. I shall look into the data agreements with outside surgeries and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
